# GRUB SHIFT: if one move kills a hivebug's drones and also hits the
# hivebug, both die, whichever the move reaches first. A hit on the
# hivebug alone does nothing while a drone guards it.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 2 1
cheat bug 2 2 7 0
cheat use 5 2 2
expect drones == 0
expect kills == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 7 0
cheat bug 2 2 2 1
cheat use 6 2 2
expect bugs == 1
expect drones == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat chip 4 13
cheat bug 1 2 7 0
cheat bug 2 2 2 1
cheat use 4 5 2
expect drones == 0
expect kills == 2
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 2 2 2 1
cheat bug 2 1 7 0
cheat chip 3 11
cheat use 3 2 2
expect kills == 2
expect drones == 1
